          {
            "id": "2079933645888880708",
            "relation": "quote",
            "depth": 1,
            "sourceTweetId": "2079933645888880708",
            "author": {
              "name": "Director Michael Kratsios",
              "handle": "mkratsios47",
              "avatarUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036415476335833088/WPlUcJxT_normal.jpg",
              "isVerified": false
            },
            "content": "We have information that Moonshot AI distilled Anthropic’s Fable for the development of its K3 model.\n\nTo do this they developed a sophisticated internal platform to conduct large scale distillation against U.S. models, allowing them to quickly switch between multiple methods of access to avoid detection. Moonshot AI has also acquired GB300-equipped servers and has accessed GB300s in Thailand, likely to train its AI models.\n\nThe United States strongly supports the free and fair development of AI, including a thriving competitive ecosystem that spans frontier models, specialized systems, open-source frameworks, and open-weight models. Legitimate AI distillation used to create smaller, more efficient models plays a vital role in this open innovation ecosystem. However, large-scale, covert industrial distillation aimed at stealing proprietary U.S. technology and undermining American research is unacceptable.",
            "createdAt": "Wed Jul 22 14:16:39 +0000 2026",
            "viewCount": 4838080,
            "metrics": {
              "views": 4838080,
              "likes": 12383,
              "retweets": 1034,
              "replies": 3086,
              "quotes": 1763,
              "bookmarks": 4230
            },
            "media": [],
            "translation": {
              "provider": "google",
              "status": "success",
              "language": "zh-CN",
              "text": "我们有消息称，Moonshot AI 提炼了 Anthropic 的《寓言》来开发其 K3 模型。\n\n为此，他们开发了一个复杂的内部平台，对美国模型进行大规模蒸馏，使他们能够在多种访问方法之间快速切换以避免被发现。 Moonshot AI 还购买了配备 GB300 的服务器，并在泰国访问了 GB300，可能用于训练其 AI 模型。\n\n美国大力支持人工智能的自由和公平发展，包括涵盖前沿模型、专业系统、开源框架和开放权重模型的蓬勃发展的竞争生态系统。用于创建更小、更高效模型的合法人工智能精炼在这个开放创新生态系统中发挥着至关重要的作用。然而，旨在窃取美国专有技术和破坏美国研究的大规模、隐蔽的工业蒸馏是不可接受的。",
              "annotations": [],
