            "content": "Fable 5 was released June 9; kimi k3 was released July 16. How exactly could they have gotten enough data and trained a frontier model, much less tested it, in that one month\n\nIf they have some way to distill a frontier model with all its capabilities from such minimal data that's actually a huge accomplishment\n\nBut unfortunately I just think this post is mostly wrong",
